            <div><p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="statusEyebrow">Release truth</p><h2 id="status-title" class="display mt-5 max-w-[450px] text-3xl font-bold leading-[1.05] sm:text-[2.65rem] lg:text-[3.15rem]" data-i18n="statusTitle">Useful now, honest about what is still open.</h2></div>
            <div class="warning-chip p-5 sm:p-7"><p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold" data-i18n="statusAlpha">pre-1.0 / alpha</p><p class="mt-5 max-w-[620px] text-lg font-semibold leading-[1.4]" data-i18n="statusBody">Rationale is pre-1.0. The core and full capture/review cycle are functional; pilot gates and human review remain visible work.</p><div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 border-t border-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--warning)_35%,transparent)] pt-5 font-mono text-[0.72rem]"><p>✓ <span data-i18n="statusEvidence">Current public evidence: v0.1.0-alpha.6</span></p><p>! <span data-i18n="statusOpen">Open: platform matrix, provider coverage and pilot gates.</span></p></div></div>
