            <div><p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="installEyebrow">Install / then initialize</p><h2 id="install-title" class="display mt-5 max-w-[520px] text-3xl font-bold leading-[1.05] sm:text-[2.65rem] lg:text-[3.15rem]" data-i18n="installTitle">Protect the why before the next change.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-[500px] text-[var(--muted-strong)]" data-i18n="installBody">The installer places the binary locally. `rationale init` creates the project canon and detects the agent configuration.</p></div>
            <div class="space-y-5">
              <div class="companion-note border border-[var(--line-strong)] bg-[var(--signal-soft)] p-4 sm:p-5">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4">
                  <div class="min-w-0"><p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="cbmEyebrow">Companion / structural coverage</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold" data-i18n="cbmTitle">Install Codebase Memory first.</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-[620px] text-sm leading-[1.5] text-[var(--muted-strong)]" data-i18n="cbmBody">Codebase Memory maps where and how the code connects; Rationale carries why. The full path uses both. Rationale can still run alone with degraded coverage.</p></div>
                  <a class="shrink-0 font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-bold text-[var(--signal-strong)] hover:underline" href={codebaseMemoryUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span data-i18n="cbmLink">Open Codebase Memory</span> ↗</a>
                </div>
                <p class="mb-2 mt-4 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)]" data-i18n="cbmCommandLabel">macOS + Linux</p>
                <div class="command-row flex items-stretch border border-[var(--line-strong)] bg-[var(--surface-inset)]"><code class="overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-3 text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--ink)] sm:px-4 sm:text-xs">{codebaseMemoryCommand}</code><button class="shrink-0 border-l border-[var(--line-strong)] px-3 font-mono text-[0.65rem] font-bold text-[var(--signal-strong)] transition-colors hover:bg-[var(--signal-soft)]" type="button" data-copy-value={codebaseMemoryCommand}><span data-copy-status data-i18n="installCopy">Copy command</span></button></div>
              </div>
              <div><p class="mb-2 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)]" data-i18n="installStep1">01 / Install Rationale · macOS + Linux</p><div class="command-row flex items-stretch border border-[var(--line-strong)] bg-[var(--surface-inset)]"><code class="overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-3 text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--ink)] sm:px-4 sm:text-xs">{installCommand}</code><button class="shrink-0 border-l border-[var(--line-strong)] px-3 font-mono text-[0.65rem] font-bold text-[var(--signal-strong)] transition-colors hover:bg-[var(--signal-soft)]" type="button" data-copy-value={installCommand}><span data-copy-status data-i18n="installCopy">Copy command</span></button></div></div>
              <div><p class="mb-2 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)]" data-i18n="installStep2">Then, inside the repository:</p><div class="command-row flex items-stretch border border-[var(--line-strong)] bg-[var(--surface-inset)]"><code class="px-3 py-3 text-xs text-[var(--ink)] sm:px-4">rationale init</code><button class="shrink-0 border-l border-[var(--line-strong)] px-3 font-mono text-[0.65rem] font-bold text-[var(--signal-strong)] transition-colors hover:bg-[var(--signal-soft)]" type="button" data-copy-value="rationale init"><span data-copy-status data-i18n="installCopy">Copy command</span></button></div></div>
              <div><p class="mb-2 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)]" data-i18n="installStep3">Check the project health:</p><div class="command-row flex items-stretch border border-[var(--line-strong)] bg-[var(--surface-inset)]"><code class="px-3 py-3 text-xs text-[var(--ink)] sm:px-4">rationale health</code><button class="shrink-0 border-l border-[var(--line-strong)] px-3 font-mono text-[0.65rem] font-bold text-[var(--signal-strong)] transition-colors hover:bg-[var(--signal-soft)]" type="button" data-copy-value="rationale health"><span data-copy-status data-i18n="installCopy">Copy command</span></button></div></div>
              <p class="border-t border-[var(--line)] pt-4 text-sm text-[var(--muted-strong)]" data-i18n="installStep4">04 / Paste the master prompt at the start of every agent conversation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

